    "created_at": "2020-07-22T07:18:13Z",
    "updated_at": "2020-07-22T07:18:13Z",
    "body": "Yeah, and again, I think we should make that less reliable. It's not like the history API has won any design awards. It's something that at some point got exposed and sites rely on to some extent, but it's also not fully interoperable or necessarily sensible given all the cross-origin leaks.",
